## counting_down_without_a_step (exit 1)
error[Z0418]: `seq` cannot reach `to` with this `step`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:1
  |
1 | seq(5, 1)
  | ^^^ the step points away from `to`
  |
  = help: the step has the sign of `to - from`: `seq(5, 1, step: -1)` counts down, and `seq(1, 5)` counts up

## wrong_sign (exit 1)
error[Z0418]: `seq` cannot reach `to` with this `step`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:17
  |
1 | seq(1, 5, step: -1)
  |                 ^^ the step points away from `to`
  |
  = help: the step has the sign of `to - from`: `seq(5, 1, step: -1)` counts down, and `seq(1, 5)` counts up

## zero_step (exit 1)
error[Z0418]: `step` of `seq` cannot be 0
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:17
  |
1 | seq(1, 5, step: 0)
  |                 ^ a step of 0 never leaves `from`
  |
  = help: write a step that moves towards `to`, as in `step: 0.5`, or `step: -1` to count down

## na_from (exit 1)
error[Z0418]: `from` of `seq` is NA
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:5
  |
1 | seq(NA, 5)
  |     ^^ NA has no value to count from
  |
  = help: a sequence needs a first value, a last value and a step; test with `is_missing` first

## na_step (exit 1)
error[Z0418]: `step` of `seq` is NA
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:17
  |
1 | seq(1, 5, step: to(NA, Float))
  |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ NA has no value to count from
  |
  = help: a sequence needs a first value, a last value and a step; test with `is_missing` first

## infinite_to (exit 1)
error[Z0418]: `to` of `seq` is not finite
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:8
  |
1 | seq(1, Inf)
  |        ^^^ an infinite value
  |
  = help: a sequence runs between two finite numbers

## too_many (exit 1)
error[Z0418]: `seq` would make 1,000,000,000 values, more than the limit of 10,000,000
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:17
  |
1 | seq(0, 1, step: 1e-9)
  |                 ^^^^ a step far smaller than the range
  |
  = help: use a larger `step`, or a shorter range

## wrong_type (exit 1)
error[Z0401]: `step` of `seq` must be a Float, but this is a Str
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:17
  |
1 | seq(1, 5, step: "a")
  |                 ^^^ a Str
  |
  = help: usage: `seq(from, to, step: Float = 1)`

## any_of_numbers (exit 1)
error[Z0401]: `list` of `any` must be a List<Bool> or Column<Bool>, but this is a List<Int>
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:5
  |
1 | any([1, 0])
  |     ^^^^^^ a List<Int>
  |
  = help: usage: `any(list)`

## empty_vars (exit 1)
error[Z0406]: `vars` needs `name`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:1
  |
1 | vars()
  | ^^^^ `name` is missing
  |
  = help: usage: `vars(name, ...)`
